WEBVTT

01:30.350 --> 01:35.009
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.190 --> 01:37.789
[Episode 9]

01:40.350 --> 01:41.400
I'm dying of laughter!

01:41.400 --> 01:42.310
Is it funny?

01:42.310 --> 01:42.920
Yes.

01:46.350 --> 01:47.350
Change your form.

01:48.509 --> 01:49.240
You can do it.

02:01.920 --> 02:02.790
Looks just like him!

02:02.790 --> 02:03.680
Amazing!

02:07.000 --> 02:09.400
I once experienced life
in the human realm,

02:09.710 --> 02:11.470
and I witnessed joy and sorrow,
partings and reunions,

02:11.470 --> 02:13.240
and the depth of parental love.

02:13.910 --> 02:16.560
To say humans have no true love

02:17.800 --> 02:19.180
is plainly biased.

02:23.310 --> 02:25.560
Xiao Mu is naturally eccentric.

02:26.190 --> 02:27.520
I usually

02:27.520 --> 02:29.470
take the blame for him.

02:30.190 --> 02:32.250
What he said just now was ill-chosen.

02:32.680 --> 02:34.810
Everyone, just listen and let it pass.

02:35.240 --> 02:37.840
Please don't take it to heart.

02:40.590 --> 02:41.680
Meow.

02:45.079 --> 02:46.840
-That's just like him!
-That's just like him!

02:46.840 --> 02:49.370
Go to the cliff now
and reflect on your faults.

02:49.810 --> 02:51.210
Anyone who pleads for her

02:51.710 --> 02:53.110
will be punished as well.

03:10.400 --> 03:11.530
Admit your mistake,

03:11.960 --> 03:13.090
and I will let you go.

03:14.910 --> 03:15.430
Fine.

03:15.960 --> 03:17.079
Apologize to me,

03:17.079 --> 03:18.880
and I'll let bygones be bygones.

03:19.000 --> 03:19.930
What did you say?

03:21.590 --> 03:22.800
You told us to change our forms,

03:22.800 --> 03:24.400
and I did it better than anyone.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.730
Why am I being punished?

03:26.000 --> 03:27.560
You openly spoke for humans

03:28.240 --> 03:30.310
and broke the demon rules.
You deserve severe punishment.

03:30.310 --> 03:31.800
Letting you reflect here

03:31.800 --> 03:33.000
is already leniency.

03:33.280 --> 03:35.280
And you still dare to push your luck?

03:35.750 --> 03:37.210
Everything I said is true.

03:38.160 --> 03:39.400
You may have your stance,

03:39.400 --> 03:40.910
but you shouldn't have ignored the facts

03:40.910 --> 03:42.570
and smeared humans like that.

03:42.630 --> 03:44.520
You were misleading the minor demons.

03:44.520 --> 03:45.150
If this continues,

03:45.150 --> 03:46.870
they will only hate humans more,

03:46.870 --> 03:49.560
and the conflict
between the two races will never end.

03:49.560 --> 03:51.360
Whether you're human or a demon,

03:52.100 --> 03:54.840
the demon realm cannot tolerate
divided loyalties.

03:54.840 --> 03:56.000
Since you are in the Demons' Valley,

03:56.000 --> 03:57.730
you can only stand with demons.

03:58.500 --> 04:00.120
Even His Lordship no longer demands

04:00.120 --> 04:01.080
that I choose one side or the other.

04:01.080 --> 04:02.810
Why are you pressing me so hard?

04:02.840 --> 04:04.520
Ever since I entered the Demons' Valley,

04:04.520 --> 04:06.030
you've been targeting me at every turn.

04:06.030 --> 04:06.960
I have swallowed my pride
and tried to appease you,

04:06.960 --> 04:08.290
yet you only escalated.

04:08.680 --> 04:10.400
I'm going to speak with His Lordship
about this.

04:10.400 --> 04:11.660
you stubborn old fool.

04:16.070 --> 04:18.390
You've been poisoning His Lordship
with your heretical ideas.

04:18.390 --> 04:20.329
Today I'll teach you a lesson.

04:20.560 --> 04:21.560
You're actually used...

04:21.560 --> 04:22.070
Yes.

04:22.600 --> 04:24.250
It's the Demon-binding Rope.

04:24.250 --> 04:25.650
Remember this, Xiao Yao.

04:25.800 --> 04:27.190
As long as I'm here,

04:27.830 --> 04:30.430
I will never allow you
to disrupt Demon Hearts.

04:31.680 --> 04:33.630
When you sincerely admit your mistake,

04:33.630 --> 04:35.720
the Demon-binding Rope
will release itself.

04:35.720 --> 04:37.120
I've done nothing wrong!

04:37.500 --> 04:39.190
I've done nothing wrong!

04:49.950 --> 04:51.360
If Xiao Dadan knows

04:51.360 --> 04:53.870
I'm being bullied like this by a cat…

05:00.870 --> 05:02.100
Are you cold?

05:02.130 --> 05:03.430
Are you hungry?

05:05.070 --> 05:06.020
Who are you?

05:08.640 --> 05:11.840
Are you Xiao Ming or Xiao Mu?

05:20.000 --> 05:21.800
Xiao Mu punished you

05:21.800 --> 05:23.560
only to teach you a lesson.

05:24.030 --> 05:24.890
How about this?

05:25.190 --> 05:26.360
Starting today,

05:26.360 --> 05:27.720
you'll water the camellias

05:27.720 --> 05:28.920
on the back hill for 3 days straight,

05:28.920 --> 05:30.520
and we'll let this matter go.

05:31.190 --> 05:32.159
It's getting late.

05:32.159 --> 05:33.310
Go back and get some rest.

05:33.310 --> 05:35.770
Since when do you care so much
about flowers?

05:38.430 --> 05:40.120
Every flower and blade of grass has life.

05:40.120 --> 05:41.659
Of course I care.

05:41.750 --> 05:43.950
Don't you only care about His Lordship?

05:44.470 --> 05:45.350
Yes.

05:45.560 --> 05:46.070
But

05:46.630 --> 05:48.270
His Lordship protects all living things.

05:48.270 --> 05:51.240
What I am doing
is helping ease his burden.

05:51.750 --> 05:52.830
Don't overthink it.

05:52.830 --> 05:53.430
Let's go.

05:53.750 --> 05:54.950
You're so beautiful.

05:55.720 --> 05:56.720
Right?

05:56.720 --> 05:58.450
I knew that today, I...

06:02.600 --> 06:03.920
I've been exposed.

06:04.360 --> 06:05.520
By whom?

06:11.920 --> 06:13.360
How could she tell
when you're so convincing?

06:13.360 --> 06:15.680
I know.
I thought I looked very convincing too.

06:15.680 --> 06:18.040
Have you ever seen a cat demon
that cares about camellias?

06:18.040 --> 06:18.560
No.

06:18.720 --> 06:19.580
Neither have I.

06:20.840 --> 06:22.380
You should have tried
to be more convincing.

06:22.380 --> 06:22.800
Right?

06:22.800 --> 06:23.560
Next time.

06:24.430 --> 06:26.630
Let's go.
Xiao Mu has gone into cultivation.

06:26.630 --> 06:27.560
Go back and get some sleep.

06:27.560 --> 06:29.070
He definitely won't find out.

06:29.070 --> 06:29.670
Watch out!

06:31.800 --> 06:33.159
The Demon-binding Rope?

06:33.159 --> 06:34.760
Why such a heavy punishment?

06:35.390 --> 06:36.980
If I could leave on my own,

06:37.310 --> 06:39.970
would I need you
to risk yourselves to rescue me?

06:41.070 --> 06:42.310
Alright. Go now.

06:42.510 --> 06:43.770
If Xiao Mu discovers this,

06:43.770 --> 06:45.630
you will be punished just like me.

06:48.070 --> 06:49.270
Hurry. Go.

06:50.360 --> 06:51.190
What are you doing?

06:51.190 --> 06:52.800
You're just leaving
because she told you to?

06:52.800 --> 06:53.430
She didn't...

06:53.430 --> 06:55.700
Let's think of another way.

06:55.920 --> 06:56.920
Don't come back.

06:57.040 --> 06:59.700
Try to make yourself comfortable, okay?

06:59.830 --> 07:00.890
Let's go. Let's go.

07:01.270 --> 07:02.720
Stop shushing me.

07:03.160 --> 07:04.010
So annoying.

07:06.920 --> 07:09.160
This Demon-binding Rope
can not only trap demons

07:09.160 --> 07:10.750
but also suppress their spiritual power,

07:10.750 --> 07:11.680
making the captive feel like

07:11.680 --> 07:14.680
their internal organs
are being crushed by boulders.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.360
What should we do?

07:16.380 --> 07:17.110
Xiao Yao said

07:17.190 --> 07:18.120
she's fine.

07:18.270 --> 07:19.040
Luoluo,

07:19.040 --> 07:21.120
Xiao Yao only said that to reassure us.

07:21.120 --> 07:22.850
How could she possibly be fine?

07:23.120 --> 07:23.580
Well...

07:23.970 --> 07:24.990
what should we do?

07:25.430 --> 07:26.640
With our power,

07:26.720 --> 07:28.850
we can't undo the Demon-binding Rope.

07:29.920 --> 07:31.190
Let's go to Youning Cave.

07:31.190 --> 07:32.270
What for?

07:32.560 --> 07:33.480
To find help.

07:33.630 --> 07:34.490
Help from whom?

07:34.990 --> 07:36.670
His Lordship. Who else?

08:09.000 --> 08:09.600
My Lord?

08:11.310 --> 08:12.310
Stay away from me.

08:13.950 --> 08:15.080
When did I

08:16.010 --> 08:17.190
displease you, My Lord?

08:17.190 --> 08:18.590
You know perfectly well.

08:22.960 --> 08:25.360
I asked you
to teach the minor demons magic,

08:25.950 --> 08:27.970
not to treat them as enemies.

08:28.610 --> 08:30.340
Xiao Yao's power is still weak,

08:30.630 --> 08:33.440
yet you punished her
with the Demon-binding Rope.

08:34.510 --> 08:36.770
Even a great demon could not endure that.

08:37.000 --> 08:38.630
How can she?

08:41.669 --> 08:42.270
My Lord,

08:43.200 --> 08:45.240
Xiao Yao has grown reckless

08:45.650 --> 08:47.250
because of your favoritism.

08:48.200 --> 08:49.800
If we don't restrain her now,

08:49.910 --> 08:51.790
what if something goes wrong
in the future?

08:51.790 --> 08:53.000
Are you going to

08:53.000 --> 08:54.510
put yourself at risk again?

08:54.510 --> 08:56.170
Put myself at risk? Nonsense!

08:58.000 --> 08:59.150
I told you to undo it.

09:09.240 --> 09:11.440
Xiao Yao spoke openly for humans today.

09:12.410 --> 09:14.540
Aren't you even a little worried?

09:16.350 --> 09:17.950
What is there to worry about?

09:25.320 --> 09:27.150
Xiao... Xiao Yao...

09:27.670 --> 09:30.300
has lived among... humans for years.

09:30.360 --> 09:32.240
Of course she has...

09:32.960 --> 09:34.120
Of course...

09:34.120 --> 09:36.880
she has more...
experience than the minor demons.

09:36.880 --> 09:39.320
I-If she said... something wrong,

09:39.480 --> 09:41.150
it... was only normal.

09:41.150 --> 09:43.080
N-No need to take it seriously.

09:44.240 --> 09:45.540
You're right, My Lord.

09:45.960 --> 09:47.420
I was being unreasonable.

09:49.130 --> 09:51.330
If you're truly worried about Xiao Yao,

09:51.910 --> 09:52.790
I can

09:52.790 --> 09:54.630
accompany you to untie her.

09:55.960 --> 09:57.480
That... that...

09:57.560 --> 09:59.460
That won't... be necessary.

10:03.700 --> 10:05.480
Well... we...

10:05.480 --> 10:06.600
Don't say anything.

10:06.600 --> 10:07.820
Just run!

10:16.470 --> 10:17.730
These students today—

10:18.640 --> 10:21.070
I really can't teach them anymore.

10:29.790 --> 10:30.910
Little grass,

10:32.390 --> 10:34.790
I'm glad I still have you
to keep me company.

10:35.480 --> 10:38.840
Otherwise, this night would be so boring.

10:40.650 --> 10:43.170
Little grass, you're so nice.

10:53.080 --> 10:53.670
Xiao Yao.

10:55.150 --> 10:56.010
Are you hungry?

10:56.150 --> 10:57.480
I brought you some food.

11:01.240 --> 11:02.840
Didn't I tell you not to come?

11:03.240 --> 11:04.550
It's very dangerous.

11:06.290 --> 11:09.980
But you really look like him this time,
Dali.

11:10.120 --> 11:11.840
Come closer. Let me see.

11:16.270 --> 11:16.980
This face.

11:17.750 --> 11:18.510
This skin.

11:22.720 --> 11:23.650
This gaze.

11:24.150 --> 11:26.610
Dali, you deserve top marks.

11:28.670 --> 11:29.870
With these top marks,

11:30.360 --> 11:31.820
should I report to His Lordship

11:31.820 --> 11:34.280
and ask him
to undo this Demon-binding Rope?

11:34.670 --> 11:35.120
No.

11:36.600 --> 11:37.030
Why?

11:39.630 --> 11:42.040
I just refused his protection.

11:42.320 --> 11:44.000
Going to him for help now

11:44.240 --> 11:45.770
would be too embarrassing.

11:46.920 --> 11:48.120
You're a minor demon.

11:48.200 --> 11:49.570
You don't need to act tough.

11:49.570 --> 11:51.830
Having someone to rely on is a good thing.

11:51.960 --> 11:53.000
Dali, remember this.

11:53.000 --> 11:54.660
Even minor demons have pride.

11:58.910 --> 11:59.550
Look.

12:00.630 --> 12:01.960
The moon is almost full.

12:03.670 --> 12:04.630
Let me tell you.

12:05.390 --> 12:08.860
The full moon of the 12th lunar month
is my birthday.

12:09.270 --> 12:10.530
Every year on that day,

12:10.550 --> 12:13.720
my dad would take me
to eat shrimp and eel noodles.

12:16.320 --> 12:18.550
Shrimp and eel noodles?

12:18.790 --> 12:19.320
Yes.

12:20.040 --> 12:21.630
He would only order one bowl.

12:21.630 --> 12:23.030
He said he didn't like it,

12:23.390 --> 12:25.840
but actually
he just didn't want to spend money.

12:25.840 --> 12:28.270
I would tell him I couldn't finish it,

12:28.270 --> 12:30.700
then share half the noodles
and half the toppings with him.

12:29.320 --> 12:32.770
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

12:33.550 --> 12:37.020
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

12:33.840 --> 12:34.720
It's just that this year

12:34.720 --> 12:37.080
I won't be able to spend it with him.

12:38.910 --> 12:41.160
I hope he'll

12:41.190 --> 12:43.870
treat himself to a whole bowl.

12:43.260 --> 12:46.680
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

12:47.530 --> 12:51.840
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

12:50.600 --> 12:51.320
He will.

12:54.270 --> 12:54.720
Hmm.

12:55.260 --> 12:57.700
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

12:56.040 --> 12:57.920
Thank you, Dali. You're so kind.

12:58.510 --> 13:01.190
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

12:59.080 --> 12:59.940
This is for you.

13:01.870 --> 13:06.340
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

13:07.330 --> 13:09.400
Little grass for a little flower.

13:09.480 --> 13:11.730
♪ Afraid of giving my true heart ♪

13:12.940 --> 13:15.270
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

13:17.590 --> 13:19.720
♪ Boiling hot ♪

13:19.270 --> 13:19.940
My Lord.

13:21.320 --> 13:23.380
I cannot continue being the teacher.

13:23.510 --> 13:25.200
Please choose another suitable teacher

13:25.200 --> 13:26.400
for the minor demons.

13:26.910 --> 13:27.630
Xiao Yao

13:28.270 --> 13:29.970
has grown unruly

13:30.320 --> 13:31.920
because of your favoritism.

13:32.250 --> 13:34.450
She's corrupting all the minor demons.

13:34.510 --> 13:34.960
They even transformed

13:34.960 --> 13:36.880
into your appearance to scare me.

13:37.510 --> 13:38.080
My Lord.

13:43.270 --> 13:43.750
My Lord?

13:45.600 --> 13:46.120
My...

13:47.790 --> 13:48.480
My Lord!

13:53.200 --> 13:55.080
Even His Lordship has been corrupted!

13:55.020 --> 13:56.950
[Three-Delicacy Noodles]
[Shrimp and Eel Noodles]

13:56.030 --> 13:56.870
Coming!

13:57.670 --> 13:58.440
Take care.

13:59.030 --> 14:00.670
Three seafood noodles! Light on soup!

14:00.670 --> 14:01.730
Please have a seat!

14:02.030 --> 14:03.160
I'll be right there.

14:03.210 --> 14:07.480
[Xu's Noodles]

14:05.550 --> 14:06.440
Excuse me, one more bowl here.

14:06.440 --> 14:07.440
This way, please.

14:07.670 --> 14:08.730
Please have a seat.

14:10.610 --> 14:12.710
[Xu's Noodles]

14:18.240 --> 14:19.300
Is it just you, sir?

14:20.360 --> 14:22.790
Is this the biggest noodle shop
in Pingjiang?

14:22.790 --> 14:23.910
You can't find

14:23.910 --> 14:25.290
a bigger one than us.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.160
One bowl of spicy soup noodles.

14:27.160 --> 14:28.240
Right this way, sir.

14:28.240 --> 14:29.150
It's crowded in the morning,

14:29.150 --> 14:30.880
so you'll have to share a table.

14:31.550 --> 14:32.210
Take a seat.

14:34.010 --> 14:35.670
What toppings would you like?

14:36.070 --> 14:36.930
Shrimp and eel.

14:37.050 --> 14:38.360
Extra green onions or no green onions?

14:38.360 --> 14:38.870
Ex-

14:41.750 --> 14:43.280
With more soup or less soup?

14:47.960 --> 14:49.150
Toppings on the side or mixed in?

14:49.150 --> 14:49.750
Excuse me!

14:50.760 --> 14:51.360
Coming!

14:54.270 --> 14:55.060
Delicious.

14:55.270 --> 14:55.870
Excuse me!

14:56.150 --> 14:57.550
I've left the money here!

14:58.000 --> 14:58.550
Alright!

14:59.480 --> 15:00.340
Take care, sir!

15:00.630 --> 15:01.890
This taste is amazing!

15:03.510 --> 15:05.510
Sir, have you decided what to order?

15:05.600 --> 15:06.320
Excuse me!

15:08.080 --> 15:09.750
Let me know when you've decided.

15:09.750 --> 15:12.080
One bowl of shrimp noodles with more soup,

15:12.480 --> 15:13.960
extra green onions, extra toppings,

15:13.960 --> 15:14.790
and toppings on the side.

15:14.790 --> 15:16.450
Alright! One shrimp noodles!

15:16.480 --> 15:18.910
More soup, extra green onions,
extra toppings, and toppings on the side!

15:18.910 --> 15:19.630
Got it!

15:21.440 --> 15:22.040
Excuse me.

15:22.220 --> 15:22.840
Coming!

15:24.960 --> 15:25.910
Sir, have you decided?

15:25.910 --> 15:27.150
One shrimp and eel noodles.

15:27.150 --> 15:27.680
Alright.

15:28.910 --> 15:29.510
More soup.

15:29.510 --> 15:29.870
Yes.

15:30.750 --> 15:31.440
Extra...

15:32.320 --> 15:32.850
Extra...

15:33.440 --> 15:34.200
You mean...

15:35.480 --> 15:36.030
Extra...

15:37.030 --> 15:38.160
Extra green onions.

15:39.270 --> 15:39.840
Extra...

15:40.390 --> 15:41.240
Extra toppings?

15:41.240 --> 15:41.790
Yes.

15:42.750 --> 15:43.360
Toppings on the side.

15:43.360 --> 15:45.620
Would you like your noodles firm or soft?

15:47.390 --> 15:47.910
Firm, please.

15:47.910 --> 15:48.480
Alright.

15:49.630 --> 15:50.960
One shrimp and eel noodles!

15:50.960 --> 15:53.480
More soup, extra green onions,
extra toppings, and toppings on the side!

15:53.480 --> 15:54.000
Got it!

16:00.120 --> 16:01.240
Crab roe noodles for table 5!

16:01.240 --> 16:01.910
Hurry up!

16:02.240 --> 16:02.600
Coming!

16:02.600 --> 16:03.400
Almost ready!

16:07.870 --> 16:08.480
Sir.

16:09.840 --> 16:11.080
Here are your noodles.

16:11.080 --> 16:11.630
Enjoy.

16:13.670 --> 16:14.960
Sirs, take care.

16:17.720 --> 16:18.510
Coming!

16:20.030 --> 16:20.830
Just a moment!

16:21.750 --> 16:22.960
Goodbye, sir.

16:25.630 --> 16:27.510
Two bowls of crab roe noodles,
more soup, extra green onions.

16:27.510 --> 16:28.710
Alright, one moment.

16:32.720 --> 16:34.670
Eel noodles, no green onions,
and toppings on the side.

16:34.670 --> 16:35.150
Got it!

16:39.390 --> 16:41.190
Excuse me, are my noodles ready?

16:41.440 --> 16:42.840
Coming right up!

16:47.320 --> 16:48.440
Sir, your noodles.

16:48.440 --> 16:49.120
Enjoy.

16:55.910 --> 16:58.180
Waiter, I've left the money on the table.

16:58.390 --> 16:59.520
Alright, take care!

17:21.240 --> 17:23.300
Today I'm personally inspecting you

17:24.109 --> 17:26.569
to see who can transform
into my appearance.

17:27.310 --> 17:28.880
Whoever looks the most like me

17:28.880 --> 17:30.200
will be rewarded.

17:31.240 --> 17:32.030
I...

17:32.030 --> 17:32.680
can't.

17:34.110 --> 17:35.310
I'll practice later.

17:36.160 --> 17:36.890
I can't do it.

17:39.400 --> 17:39.980
I dare not.

17:39.980 --> 17:40.720
I can!

17:41.830 --> 17:43.290
We can only do it together.

17:44.220 --> 17:47.280
-Because before, we...
-Because you two did it before.

17:47.790 --> 17:48.750
How did you know?

17:52.820 --> 17:54.320
Why do you think I know?

17:55.720 --> 17:56.270
Oh no.

17:59.200 --> 18:00.690
You're such a pig!

18:01.510 --> 18:02.000
Hmm...

18:03.640 --> 18:04.500
Take care, sir.

18:11.720 --> 18:12.240
Sir.

18:12.750 --> 18:13.480
You've been occupying this table all day

18:13.480 --> 18:15.550
and only ordered this one bowl of noodles.

18:15.550 --> 18:17.030
Would you like anything else?

18:17.030 --> 18:18.630
If not, we're about to close.

18:18.680 --> 18:19.270
Yes.

18:19.880 --> 18:21.160
Let me use your kitchen.

18:21.160 --> 18:23.290
I'll make the noodles, and you'll eat.

18:25.110 --> 18:25.900
Is it not enough?

18:25.900 --> 18:27.240
It is.

18:38.400 --> 18:39.730
After watching all day,

18:40.030 --> 18:42.070
even a fool would have learned it by now.

18:42.070 --> 18:43.870
How could it be difficult for me?

19:21.160 --> 19:21.920
Take it slow.

19:23.350 --> 19:24.070
Low heat.

19:25.000 --> 19:26.400
Oil at medium-high heat.

19:26.400 --> 19:27.550
Then add the eggs.

20:00.880 --> 20:02.400
Why isn't it done yet?

20:41.270 --> 20:42.000
Have a taste.

20:42.480 --> 20:43.590
If the taste isn't right,

20:43.590 --> 20:44.450
I'll try again.

20:52.440 --> 20:53.440
How does it taste?

21:03.350 --> 21:04.750
Why is it so terrible?

21:05.000 --> 21:07.160
It's indeed not good enough.

21:10.310 --> 21:11.370
I'll go improve it.

21:11.790 --> 21:12.160
Sir.

21:12.440 --> 21:13.590
Perhaps we should call it a day.

21:13.590 --> 21:15.160
It's getting late. Let's get some rest,

21:15.160 --> 21:15.920
shall we?

21:18.400 --> 21:20.060
One ingot of silver per taste,

21:20.070 --> 21:21.470
until the taste is right.

21:24.240 --> 21:25.310
Deal!

21:42.110 --> 21:42.750
Xiao Yao.

21:44.030 --> 21:44.720
Wake up.

21:56.550 --> 21:58.550
A full day and night should be enough

21:58.720 --> 22:01.450
for you to reflect on
where you went wrong, right?

22:03.270 --> 22:04.440
If you admit your mistake,

22:04.440 --> 22:05.300
I'll let you go,

22:06.350 --> 22:08.680
so you won't suffer
more than you can bear.

22:09.090 --> 22:10.790
What did I do wrong?

22:11.270 --> 22:12.480
I'm doing just fine here.

22:12.480 --> 22:13.480
I'm quite at ease.

22:13.640 --> 22:15.970
If you have any more tricks,
bring them on.

22:23.270 --> 22:23.920
You may go.

22:26.070 --> 22:27.640
You're naturally intelligent,

22:27.640 --> 22:29.500
but you act far too unrestrained.

22:30.110 --> 22:33.040
Plus, you're different
from both humans and demons.

22:33.880 --> 22:35.270
If you do not restrain your nature

22:35.270 --> 22:36.730
and discipline yourself,

22:38.350 --> 22:41.610
I'm afraid you'll one day
become a calamity to both realms.

22:43.030 --> 22:44.230
Are you done talking?

22:44.550 --> 22:46.150
I've said all I needed to say.

22:46.440 --> 22:47.750
Are you leaving or not?

22:51.720 --> 22:53.480
If I truly had the ability
to bring ruin to both realms,

22:53.480 --> 22:55.350
you would not be able to defeat me.

23:00.070 --> 23:01.270
A calamity?

23:01.570 --> 23:02.830
A calamity can last for ages.

23:02.830 --> 23:04.270
I can live a very long time.

23:04.270 --> 23:04.800
Xiao Yao.

23:21.680 --> 23:22.240
Dali!

23:23.030 --> 23:23.590
Dali!

23:23.790 --> 23:24.720
Dali!

23:26.240 --> 23:27.310
I'm finally out!

23:27.480 --> 23:28.750
I'm finally out.

23:29.550 --> 23:31.520
You were going to visit me, weren't you?

23:31.520 --> 23:33.400
You're truly my good friend.

23:33.510 --> 23:35.110
So this is how you usually

23:35.110 --> 23:36.170
treat Dali Flower?

23:43.830 --> 23:44.480
You're...

23:45.160 --> 23:45.960
the real one?

23:46.830 --> 23:47.690
Does it matter?

23:48.750 --> 23:50.550
It does. So last night...

23:52.640 --> 23:54.110
Today is the 15th day
of the 12th lunar month.

23:54.110 --> 23:56.710
Come on.
I'll take you to eat birthday noodles.

23:57.400 --> 24:00.030
So... that was you last night?

24:00.160 --> 24:01.160
What do you think?

24:10.350 --> 24:10.830
Luoluo.

24:12.590 --> 24:13.640
Luoluo!

24:15.000 --> 24:17.350
Luoluo!

24:26.680 --> 24:27.400
What is it?

24:28.270 --> 24:30.130
Xiao Yao's birthday is coming up.

24:30.160 --> 24:32.620
What do you think we should give her
as a gift?

24:33.920 --> 24:35.440
I already have it prepared.

24:35.440 --> 24:37.350
I've saved up
lots and lots of delicious treats.

24:37.350 --> 24:38.510
I'll give them all to her

24:38.510 --> 24:40.510
and let her pick whatever she likes.

24:40.550 --> 24:42.030
You always talk about food.

24:42.030 --> 24:43.640
Once food is eaten,

24:43.640 --> 24:44.480
it's gone by the next day.

24:44.480 --> 24:45.720
Nothing remains.

24:47.110 --> 24:48.160
I just want to

24:48.160 --> 24:50.030
give her what I think is the best.

24:51.640 --> 24:53.310
You're certainly sincere with Xiao Yao.

24:53.310 --> 24:54.680
You're never willing to give me treats.

24:54.680 --> 24:56.270
If you like them, I can give you some too.

24:56.270 --> 24:57.870
Just keep them for yourself.

24:58.400 --> 24:59.800
Let me ask you something.

24:59.960 --> 25:02.110
Who are you closer with, me or Xiao Yao?

25:02.350 --> 25:03.000
You...

25:04.070 --> 25:05.030
and Xiao Yao

25:05.030 --> 25:06.880
are both my very best friends.

25:08.160 --> 25:09.000
Well,

25:09.350 --> 25:11.070
most of the things Xiao Yao likes

25:11.070 --> 25:12.550
are from the human realm.

25:12.550 --> 25:13.030
Yes.

25:13.140 --> 25:15.200
And we can't conjure money right now,

25:15.350 --> 25:17.200
so how are we supposed to
buy her anything there?

25:17.200 --> 25:18.270
But we are demons.

25:19.200 --> 25:20.350
We've learned so many demonic arts.

25:20.350 --> 25:21.750
We should put them to use.

25:21.920 --> 25:23.250
Didn't our teacher say?

25:23.440 --> 25:27.640
A beautiful appearance is most effective
for bewitching humans.

25:27.900 --> 25:31.490
[Dade Tea House]

25:32.470 --> 25:34.240
You must be lying.

25:34.880 --> 25:37.270
At this hour,
all the noodle shops should be closed.

25:37.270 --> 25:39.530
Where could we possibly get noodles now?

25:39.550 --> 25:40.510
Just follow me.

25:46.830 --> 25:51.680
[Xu's Noodles]

25:52.750 --> 25:53.830
This noodle shop

25:53.830 --> 25:55.350
usually closes after dark.

25:55.350 --> 25:56.810
Why is it still open today?

26:04.220 --> 26:07.830
[Three-Delicacy Noodles]
[Shrimp and Eel Noodles]

26:10.920 --> 26:12.030
Sir, you're here.

26:12.400 --> 26:14.930
We've been keeping the stove
burning for you.

26:15.960 --> 26:18.220
I won't need to trouble you with the rest.

26:18.920 --> 26:20.780
-Thank you, sir.
-Thank you, sir.

26:20.830 --> 26:21.550
Let's go.

26:22.070 --> 26:22.510
Let's go.

26:22.510 --> 26:24.110
You sent everyone away,

26:24.110 --> 26:26.040
so who's going to make the noodles?

26:26.240 --> 26:26.970
Come with me.

26:33.720 --> 26:34.240
Ma'am,

26:35.270 --> 26:36.330
please have a seat.

26:49.590 --> 26:50.440
Ma'am.

26:50.750 --> 26:52.680
What would you like to eat tonight?

26:55.830 --> 26:58.590
Shrimp and eel noodles.

26:58.750 --> 26:59.310
Hmm.

26:59.880 --> 27:01.610
Spicy soup or non-spicy broth?

27:02.960 --> 27:03.720
Spicy soup.

27:04.000 --> 27:05.260
With more or less soup?

27:08.880 --> 27:11.010
Extra green onions or no green onions?

27:11.590 --> 27:13.720
With more soup and extra green onions.

27:14.240 --> 27:16.040
Toppings on the side or mixed in?

27:16.680 --> 27:17.480
On the side.

27:18.150 --> 27:19.240
And add a fried egg.

27:19.550 --> 27:20.950
I have one last question.

27:21.590 --> 27:23.590
Do you want the noodles firm or soft?

27:23.830 --> 27:24.480
A bit soft.

27:24.960 --> 27:26.960
Spicy soup noodles with more soup.

27:26.960 --> 27:29.480
Extra green onions, toppings on the side,
shrimp and eel.

27:29.480 --> 27:30.010
Alright!

27:31.030 --> 27:32.000
Please wait a moment.

27:32.000 --> 27:33.000
Coming right up.

28:56.790 --> 28:58.590
Where did you learn to make this?

29:02.590 --> 29:03.650
It smells amazing.

29:04.830 --> 29:05.550
Try it.

29:24.790 --> 29:25.350
How is it?

29:29.960 --> 29:32.270
These are the best noodles I've ever had.

29:32.690 --> 29:35.520
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

29:35.550 --> 29:36.200
Eat up.

29:36.550 --> 29:37.510
After midnight,

29:37.040 --> 29:39.900
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

29:37.880 --> 29:39.810
it won't be your birthday anymore.

29:41.260 --> 29:43.970
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

29:45.040 --> 29:48.130
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

29:47.640 --> 29:48.310
Eat up.

29:49.810 --> 29:52.480
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

29:54.010 --> 29:56.940
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue
in the mountains ♪

29:58.330 --> 30:01.220
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

30:02.400 --> 30:05.020
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

30:08.680 --> 30:12.020
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

30:13.150 --> 30:16.330
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

30:17.580 --> 30:20.720
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

30:21.870 --> 30:24.780
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

30:29.550 --> 30:30.510
I heard

30:30.880 --> 30:32.010
that humans believe

30:32.200 --> 30:34.660
if you blow out red candles
on your birthday,

30:34.720 --> 30:36.250
your wishes will come true.

30:41.160 --> 30:43.490
That's just something to trick children.

30:43.880 --> 30:44.480
Is that so?

30:45.350 --> 30:47.030
But at your age,

30:45.410 --> 30:48.030
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

30:47.160 --> 30:48.760
aren't you just a child to me?

30:49.060 --> 30:52.190
♪ I brew years of romance
and longing into wine ♪

30:53.170 --> 30:57.330
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

30:58.310 --> 31:01.010
♪ Eternal sorrows end, the broken cocoon
becomes an ark ♪

31:02.090 --> 31:05.020
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

31:03.960 --> 31:05.220
What wish did you make?

31:05.680 --> 31:06.310
Guess.

31:06.040 --> 31:09.260
♪ I boil away my worries
with dew and strands of hair ♪

31:09.550 --> 31:10.960
To roam the vast world

31:10.190 --> 31:14.280
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

31:11.590 --> 31:12.510
at will.

31:13.720 --> 31:14.920
How did you know that?

31:15.500 --> 31:18.950
♪ Three lives of joy,
growing old with one heart ♪

31:16.400 --> 31:17.860
That was my wish last year.

31:18.550 --> 31:20.070
This year I wished for…

31:24.000 --> 31:24.550
Waiter!

31:27.790 --> 31:28.790
A bowl of noodles!

31:30.830 --> 31:31.830
I'm starving.

31:40.440 --> 31:41.170
Coming, sir.

31:41.960 --> 31:44.000
Just noodles, plain noodles.

31:44.920 --> 31:45.790
Nothing added.

31:47.160 --> 31:47.960
Hurry, hurry!

31:48.240 --> 31:49.030
I'm hungry!

32:08.640 --> 32:09.350
Enjoy, sir.

32:43.720 --> 32:44.400
Waiter!

32:46.400 --> 32:47.260
Check, please!

32:54.440 --> 32:55.000
Waiter,

32:56.400 --> 32:57.790
is this a rip-off shop?

32:59.030 --> 33:01.030
I said I only wanted plain noodles,

33:02.000 --> 33:03.110
no toppings.

33:04.550 --> 33:05.880
You added all this stuff.

33:05.880 --> 33:07.110
I'm not paying for it.

33:07.550 --> 33:09.110
I only have these few coins.

33:11.350 --> 33:13.110
We're celebrating something today.

33:13.110 --> 33:15.070
This bowl of noodles is on the house.

33:15.070 --> 33:15.960
It's free?

33:16.960 --> 33:18.690
You should've said so earlier.

33:18.880 --> 33:21.400
Then I wouldn't have eaten
this bowl of noodles.

33:21.400 --> 33:22.200
You want more?

33:22.590 --> 33:23.480
Then I'll make you another one.

33:23.480 --> 33:24.110
No, no, no.

33:27.310 --> 33:28.440
I can't eat anymore.

33:29.680 --> 33:30.480
I'm full.

33:32.960 --> 33:34.420
What are you celebrating?

33:35.350 --> 33:36.030
Today...

33:39.310 --> 33:41.510
is the birthday of an important person.

33:46.590 --> 33:48.110
You should have told me earlier.

33:48.110 --> 33:49.070
Sit, sit.

33:49.960 --> 33:51.240
Let's chat.

33:53.440 --> 33:56.100
What a coincidence.
It's a double celebration.

33:56.790 --> 33:57.590
Today

33:58.200 --> 34:01.350
is also my precious daughter's birthday.

34:05.200 --> 34:05.790
I'm...

34:06.400 --> 34:08.630
I'm only telling you this.

34:08.920 --> 34:10.510
Don't tell anyone else.

34:11.960 --> 34:13.320
Every year

34:13.320 --> 34:15.030
on my precious daughter's birthday,

34:15.030 --> 34:17.429
I would bring her here
for a bowl of noodles.

34:18.030 --> 34:19.400
Her favorite is these

34:20.920 --> 34:21.980
fried eel noodles.

34:23.230 --> 34:24.360
This is expensive.

34:25.000 --> 34:26.199
How could I afford it?

34:27.070 --> 34:29.030
I'd buy just one bowl for her to eat.

34:29.670 --> 34:31.440
I told her I didn't like noodles,

34:31.440 --> 34:32.570
and she said, "Dad,"

34:32.800 --> 34:34.400
"if you don't like noodles,"

34:35.480 --> 34:37.030
"you can eat the toppings."

34:37.960 --> 34:39.670
"There are eggs and eel

34:40.960 --> 34:41.510
in them."

34:42.360 --> 34:43.960
I knew she was being filial,

34:45.710 --> 34:47.400
and I wanted her to eat more

34:47.960 --> 34:49.670
and grow up quickly,

34:51.030 --> 34:52.429
so I pretended to be angry

34:52.920 --> 34:53.780
to make her eat.

34:54.280 --> 34:55.880
Then she insisted that I eat.

34:56.880 --> 34:58.670
And guess what happened in the end?

34:58.670 --> 34:59.960
With one egg,

35:01.230 --> 35:02.710
she ate the yolk

35:03.070 --> 35:04.510
and I ate the white.

35:14.590 --> 35:15.630
I don't know why,

35:17.000 --> 35:19.440
but they say she turned into a demon.

35:20.800 --> 35:23.550
My daughter and I
never had a single peaceful day,

35:23.760 --> 35:25.190
all because of demons.

35:26.110 --> 35:26.710
But...

35:28.400 --> 35:30.960
how could she have become one?

35:36.070 --> 35:37.880
I've only told you this.

35:39.320 --> 35:40.800
Don't tell anyone else.

35:46.020 --> 35:49.380
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

35:50.250 --> 35:53.710
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

35:52.480 --> 35:54.680
I've been looking for her for a long time

35:55.800 --> 35:57.060
but couldn't find her.

35:59.960 --> 36:03.420
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

36:00.280 --> 36:01.810
Maybe it's better that way.

36:04.190 --> 36:05.840
Otherwise, we'd just
be running for our lives together,

36:04.230 --> 36:08.540
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

36:06.150 --> 36:07.440
forever.

36:11.960 --> 36:14.400
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

36:15.210 --> 36:17.810
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

36:18.790 --> 36:23.110
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

36:18.840 --> 36:21.230
My daughter can't be a demon.

36:22.320 --> 36:24.000
She can't be.

36:25.510 --> 36:26.800
Even if she were,

36:26.130 --> 36:28.670
♪ The armor I dare not cast away ♪

36:27.320 --> 36:28.880
she'd be a good demon.

36:29.640 --> 36:32.000
♪ The red cheeks ♪

36:30.280 --> 36:31.960
You'll never catch her.

36:33.150 --> 36:34.010
I will never...

36:34.290 --> 36:35.520
♪ Cold ♪

36:34.840 --> 36:37.630
let you catch her.

36:39.510 --> 36:40.630
You...

36:40.450 --> 36:42.770
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

36:41.480 --> 36:44.320
will never catch her.

36:43.710 --> 36:45.490
♪ A thousand years is just ♪

36:46.000 --> 36:47.230
You'll never...

36:46.360 --> 36:51.110
♪ A fleeting moment's grand display ♪

36:48.000 --> 36:49.760
catch her.

36:54.960 --> 36:55.590
Go now.

36:55.240 --> 36:59.650
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

36:56.630 --> 36:57.690
He hasn't gone far.

37:00.450 --> 37:04.990
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

37:00.630 --> 37:01.920
Or you'll regret it.

37:05.920 --> 37:08.650
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

37:09.740 --> 37:11.330
♪ The chains of fate ♪

37:12.200 --> 37:15.980
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

37:16.730 --> 37:20.490
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

37:21.350 --> 37:22.810
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

37:23.870 --> 37:25.380
♪ Both flushing ♪

37:25.760 --> 37:30.960
[Tea]

37:26.320 --> 37:29.930
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

37:30.860 --> 37:35.990
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

37:37.340 --> 37:39.610
[Pingjiang Prefecture]

37:39.310 --> 37:42.360
♪ Moments ♪

37:43.150 --> 37:43.670
Hey.

37:44.150 --> 37:45.360
It's the middle of the night.

37:45.360 --> 37:46.440
What are you doing wandering around?

37:46.440 --> 37:47.840
Hand over

37:48.400 --> 37:49.480
everything valuable

37:49.480 --> 37:50.480
you've got on you.

37:52.960 --> 37:54.070
I'm talking to you.

37:54.400 --> 37:55.460
Didn't you hear me?

37:56.400 --> 37:58.000
If you want to live, get lost.

37:59.000 --> 38:00.400
You're asking for death!

38:04.590 --> 38:06.710
You dare mess with him?
You're asking for death!

38:05.360 --> 38:08.140
♪ A thousand years have flowed by ♪

38:07.440 --> 38:08.230
Little girl!

38:08.590 --> 38:09.590
You know demonic art?

38:09.590 --> 38:11.760
♪ Turning into tears
that brim over my eyes ♪

38:13.230 --> 38:15.490
♪ And the moonlight to heal sorrow ♪

38:16.620 --> 38:19.470
♪ The sweetness of the world
always tastes like the first time ♪

38:19.590 --> 38:20.630
Why are you back?

38:20.580 --> 38:23.650
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

38:21.590 --> 38:23.510
I didn't gather enough morning dew
at the Moon-Gazing Terrace

38:23.510 --> 38:24.510
to make tea.

38:24.810 --> 38:27.170
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

38:25.280 --> 38:27.760
The birthday noodles you made
were delicious.

38:27.760 --> 38:29.150
I wanted a few more bowls.

38:28.500 --> 38:30.850
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

38:29.960 --> 38:31.160
But didn't you always

38:31.970 --> 38:34.220
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

38:32.230 --> 38:34.090
want to return to the human realm?

38:35.490 --> 38:38.560
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

38:35.510 --> 38:36.710
Life

38:36.840 --> 38:37.910
is short.

38:38.280 --> 38:40.760
One should follow their heart
in the moment.

38:39.560 --> 38:42.130
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

38:42.030 --> 38:42.920
As for what comes later,

38:42.920 --> 38:46.180
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

38:43.230 --> 38:44.320
who knows?

38:47.240 --> 38:51.390
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

39:11.080 --> 39:14.010
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

39:15.130 --> 39:17.630
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

39:18.830 --> 39:21.330
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

39:22.580 --> 39:24.730
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

39:25.720 --> 39:28.840
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

39:26.360 --> 39:27.760
So are you still leaving?

39:29.670 --> 39:31.360
Well, I can't leave now anyway.

39:29.830 --> 39:32.440
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

39:33.050 --> 39:36.490
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

39:35.230 --> 39:37.030
How could I bring myself to do it?

39:37.570 --> 39:39.880
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

39:40.900 --> 39:44.180
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

39:45.130 --> 39:47.690
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

39:48.380 --> 39:51.650
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

39:53.070 --> 39:58.650
♪ Giving up three lives of marriage
just for ♪

40:02.670 --> 40:04.120
♪ Our wishes ♪

40:04.070 --> 40:05.400
Did you see your father?

40:06.630 --> 40:07.150
Yes.

40:08.230 --> 40:10.320
I followed him for a long time,

40:11.510 --> 40:14.240
but in the end,
I held back from calling out to him.

40:15.760 --> 40:17.620
I didn't want to bring him danger.

40:19.480 --> 40:20.280
His daughter

40:20.960 --> 40:22.480
has indeed become a demon.

40:23.960 --> 40:26.220
Things can never go back to how they were.

40:26.710 --> 40:27.480
Xiao Yao.

40:29.920 --> 40:31.580
You will have a better future.

40:35.630 --> 40:37.320
Although midnight has already passed,

40:37.320 --> 40:38.920
may I make one more wish?

40:39.440 --> 40:40.000
Go on.

40:40.760 --> 40:42.190
I heard those demon-hunting sects

40:42.190 --> 40:43.150
have a technique

40:43.150 --> 40:44.490
called sword flight.

40:44.710 --> 40:46.550
It's riding on swords in the sky.

40:46.880 --> 40:48.340
Can demon arts do that too?

40:49.190 --> 40:50.280
Easy peasy.

41:09.280 --> 41:10.360
One more time!

41:10.760 --> 41:11.590
Do it again!

41:27.190 --> 41:28.280
It's so beautiful!

41:55.840 --> 41:57.570
Then pick the one you like best.

42:06.150 --> 42:07.000
This one. This one.
